 p  introduced his young diana to an  athletic contest featuring gymnastics  swimming equestrian skills and archery  she also gives her a little bit of  advice both for the competition and life  in general  just do your best and remember  greatness is not what you think the  scrappy diana is ahead of the game for a  while  until the branch knocks her off her  horse she scrambles down a hill  taking a shortcut to catch up with her  mount but antiope stops her short of the  finish line  she then tells her niece you're not  ready to win and there is no shame in  that  no true hero is born from lies her  aunt's wise words stay with diana years  later  as does her tiara which she balancer  gave to diana before she left home  in the 2017 film barbara minerva better  known as cheetah  is one of wonder woman's longtime foes  in the comics barbara is an  archaeologist and professor  interested in the civilization of the  amazons diana and barbara become friends  but their friendship turned sour after  barbara goes on an expedition to  investigate the ancient god as kataga  earthquake captures barbara who agrees  by the promise of immortality  to be his tribe's new guardian she  drinks a potion that turns her into a  feline human  complete with orange skin black spots  claws and a tail although wonder woman  1984 revamps its origin story to a  considerable extent  it keeps certain elements notably the  spark of friendship between the two  this time around barbara is a gorky  geologist gemologist and part-time  cryptozoologists who is in ore of  diana's beauty  strength and ability to walk in cheetah  print heals after the fbi asked the  smithsonian to identify certain relics  one of which turns out to be a  wish-granting stone  barbara wishes she could be just like  diana inadvertently gaining super speed  strength and agility like the short  story the monkey's poor the wishes  involve some dire consequences but  barbara won't renounce her wish  determined never to be an awkward  doormat again  wealthy businessman and entrepreneur  maxwell lord has been knocking around  the dc universe since the 1980s  at one point in the comics playing a key  role in organizing the superhero team  known as justice league international  during the late 1980s crossover event  invasion  readers learned that lord was actually a  meta human with mind control abilities  but this character's extensive backstory  also includes other affiliations  including the black lantern corps  the illuminati and the extremists that  said wonder woman  1984 director patty jenkins told people  that their version of lord is more  inspired by controversial headline  grabbing business mavericks like bernie  madoff and donald trump  pedro pascal currently the dadalorian to  the famous baby yoda on the mandalorian  star wars series  plays lord as a would-be oil tycoon with  blonde hair big ambitions and the  intense desperation of a guy out to  prove he's not a loser  meanwhile the character has a young son  who loves him just fine the way he is  pascal who memorably played the viper  oberyn martel on game of thrones  incidentally has another title wonder  woman he appeared as the indelically  named character  edin delicato in the unreleased wonder  woman tv pilot from 2011 which starred  adrian palicki as diana  us air force pilot steve trevor has been  wonder woman's love interest since the  1940s so it was natural to introduce a  romance between steve and diana in the  2017 film  as steve chris pine had such natural  chemistry with gal gadot  that even though his character died the  filmmakers wanted to bring him back in  some capacity  despite the death-defying return steve's  comeback made sense for the characters  and the actors both  as pine told entertainment weekly  there's parity in the relationship and  they support one another they bring out  the best parts of one another diana  doesn't mean to bring steve back from  the dead in wonder woman 1984.  she just wishes around that magical  stone that she could see him again  but she hasn't been in love since their  time together during world war one  and still misses him dearly we won't  spoil how things turn out for this  timeless couple  except to say that steve once again  makes diana's heart sore  when steve trevor comes back from the  dead his spirit actually inhabits the  body of another guy  built only in the credits as handsome  man something we'll bet amuses actor  christopher balohar to no end when steve  and diana first reunite the handsome  mana tagalog gives her a watch and  repeats his passing words from the 2017  film  i wish we had more time the bewildering  moment for diana develops into something  magical  as a man transforms in diana's eyes to  the steve she loves but the  cinematography and an occasional mirror  made clear that while she and the  audience see piner steve the other  characters see the unnamed man  when the woman 1984 doesn't provide any  backstory for the mysterious guy  but paloha is a familiar face in his own  right the veteran actor has made  appearances on tv shows like madmen  castle and ballers he's also set to  appear in the third entry in the  jurassic world  series jurassic world dominion in one  action sequence diana and steve chase  after a military convoy protecting  maxwell lord  who through the power of the wishing  stone has acquired both the oil  and the bodyguards of emir saeed bin  abados played by amra waked  lord have been jealous of the emir he  was featured on a magazine cover around  the same time that lord's less than  effective wells  seemed to be little more than a ponzi  scheme the emir at first scoffs at the  idea that lord could offer him anything  he might want  then looks over the city of cairo in  egypt and wishes that his ancestral  lands could be returned  the film doesn't explain the politics  behind the emir's wish  but it's granted in a snap causing chaos  for people in the region  although his role is brief viewers might  recognize wakeed a native of cairo as  comedian rami yusef's father on the hulu  comedy series rami  waked has also appeared in siriana lucy  geostorm  and netflix's marco polo series diana  has several co-workers at the  smithsonian institution  but one in particular stands out for  having a link to kristen wiig's past  natasha rothwell plays carol who looks  right past the clumsy barbara minerva  even though barbara reminds her that  carol hired her in the first place  carol appears briefly introducing  barbara and diana  and giving them a heads up about the fbi  wanting the smithsonian's assistance and  identifying several recovered artifacts  including the mysterious stone rothwell  is a veteran both in front of and behind  the camera she has appeared in tv and  films such as sonic the hedgehog  brooklyn nine-nine  and the current iteration of ducktales  she is the voice of zan  alson an owl businesswoman and mayor of  saint canard she's also an executive  story editor on the hbo comedy insecure  and was a writer on saturday night live  from 2014 to 2015  during wig's heyday camera might not  recognize barbara minerva at first sight  but it's likely that rothwell and wig  shared some snl stories between takes  wonder woman 1984 includes several  character actors  some of whom have other pop culture  appearances one of those is stewart  milligan who plays the president of the  united states the real president  in 1984 was ronald reagan at the time  the oldest person ever to be nominated  by a major party for the office  milligan doesn't try to imitate reagan  but plays his role straight  his president finds his appointment  calendar suddenly cleared for a meeting  with maxwell lord  thanks to lord wishing his way to the  top of the list diana tries to intercept  the lord at the white house  leading to a fight sequence against both  an empowered barbara and animal prince  and the secret service  with steve providing backup if milligan  looks familiar perhaps it's because he  previously played president richard  nixon  during a 2011 story arc on doctor who he  also voiced colonel stark in the 2009  animated miniseries doctor who dreamland  and appeared in other sci-fi films  such as sky captain in the world of  tomorrow and outland  wonder woman 1984 gives diana both her  iconic costume and gold armor with wings  a reference to the ceremonial battle  armor the amazon artisan palace created  for her  as extra protection whenever facing an  extremely powerful villain  in the film the armor has a different  origin story queen hippolyta tells a  young diana about a brave amazon  named asteria who wore the golden armor  to protect her sister's retreat to  themschira when they left the regular  world diana later relates this legend to  steve  explaining how she's recovered the  golden armor of asteria over her years  of working with antiquities diana later  wears the armor as extra protection  during the film's climax  yet a post-credit scene reveals that  asteria didn't die while protecting that  ancient retreat  she's been living among us too played by  linda carter  tv's original live-action wonder woman  from the 1970s  the cameo is an obvious tribute to the  beloved carter who at dc  fandom in 2020 thanked jenkins and  gaddut for their treatment of the iconic  character  according to carter seeing jenkins and  gadit's interpretation of wonder woman  made her own daughter  finally understand what the character  was all about she said mom  i finally get it i finally get  what wonder woman means to everyone  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite superhero movies are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss  a single one  you
 

